@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title PostgreSQL 17.6 / platform / V1-V26\nAll 89 tables / storage groups
legend top left
PK = primary key; FK = foreign-key column; ? = nullable
Arrows: referenced parent -> referencing child; no cardinality inference.
External tables are reference stubs. Full constraints/indexes/triggers: schema catalog.
endlegend
